Wed Nov 25 08:59:51 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to version 0.6.9:
  * Install the C headers via cargo cinstall; ship them in the
    devel package under the private include/z_rs subdir
  * Fix undefined behaviour when an Inflate or Deflate handle
    is dropped
  * Fix buffered bit alignment and a NULL-pointer slice in
    inflateSync
  * Preserve the configured window size in inflate
  * Reset the pending output cursor when resetting deflate
  * Mask ignored value bits in deflatePrime
  * Account for distance code bits in inflateMark
  * Let total_in/total_out counters wrap past 4 GiB on 32-bit
    targets
  * Performance improvements in crc32, deflate matching and runtime
    dispatch, including an aarch64-specific deflate_quick speedup
  * Support no_std builds and add an altivec feature for PowerPC

